    "description": "Related to [BUILD-194 — Referrer: Dedup-on-Create (hard block)](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693253453254/f/) — TBD when Dedupe logic is defined. \n\n# RF-6: Duplicate Review Fields\n\n_Flag-and-review fields shown when a possible duplicate Referrer is detected — overlaps with RF-10's hard block._\n\n### FIELDS\n\n* Possible Duplicate Of — Lookup to Referrer, locked\n* Primary Email Match — locked\n* Matched On — locked (e.g., phone exact match, last name exact match)\n* Reviewed By — Lookup to User, editable\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Conflicts with RF-10's hard email block — needs a decision\n\n* Not confirmed in the transcript. RF-10 confirms creation is blocked outright on a matching email; this section instead describes a flag-and-review pattern (phone/name match, Reviewed By, no block). Two ways to reconcile: the hard block replaces this section entirely, or it only covers email while this catches phone/name matches. See [BUILD-194 — Referrer: Dedup-on-Create (hard block)](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693253453254/f/).\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Provenance: RF-6 (Referrer Record User Stories doc).\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* [Taryn doc RF-6 — Referrer Record User Stories](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MsJXwt3oY-DyQuAdMzNYlyPenKUQl7g8mHzMmeRaVHs/edit?tab=t.lh55xwl5syhi)\n* Dependencies: [BUILD-185 — Referrer: Object + Core Status](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693311564006/f/), [BUILD-194 — Referrer: Dedup-on-Create (hard block)](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693253453254/f/)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-20 from Referrer record documentation review.\n\n",
